{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Xvgt5IOlRd1795682489.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>私下向來熱愛運動的陳星妤（Yvette），近日在社交平台上載了兩段健身短片，分別記錄她與《女神配對計劃2》兩位拍檔關經翰（Oswald）及李爾晨（Kyle）一同操肌的互動過程，更在帖文中幽默點評二人截然不同的教學風格。</p><h3></h3><p>在與關經翰同框的片段中，陳星妤正手持啞鈴進行深蹲訓練。期間關經翰全程在旁緊盯她的動作姿勢，並不時伸手指點發力位置；當完成動作後，二人更甜蜜擊掌，現場粉紅泡泡滿瀉！陳星妤亦在帖文中大爆對方的貼心一面，寫道：「我叫 Oswald 行開我要錄片，佢話唔得啊我要 guide 住你 d 動作㗎！」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d37730f6-8312-4275-b54f-6545ef75ecc4.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026oLicx2YnTN1795682489.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5cba269c-a75a-4a55-a638-c85e6e8b9a90.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026L24bjWhRrG1795682488.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c4d6bceb-d6f8-42a5-a7b2-2642c29eca27.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026U2EXaGMD0h1795682488.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><h3></h3><p>至於另一段與十年摯友李爾晨一同做 Gym 的片段，陳星妤則換上全黑長袖貼身上衣配搭黑色長褲操練滑雪機，緊身造型完美勾勒出零贅肉的纖細腰臀曲線。不過，向來與她「互串」慣的李爾晨卻完全不解風情，大發揮毒舌本色狂笑對方的穿搭！陳星妤無奈發文寫道：「Kyle 笑我著到成身 wetsuit 咁好似準備潛水...」而李爾晨隨後亦在評論區搞笑回覆：「著潛水衣做 Gym 係你先諗到！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.773406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":441,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:13.226858+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:16.649948+00:00","content_hash":"2def6dc4a78bbc168ec3c2b625f27194528b694da8161922098a66381cc0bcb7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.773406+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_